{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35700","headline":"轻薄怨 · 李咸用","name":"轻薄怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花骢躞蹀游龙骄，连连宝节挥长鞘。\n凤雏麟子皆至交，春风相逐垂杨桥。\n捻笙软玉开素苞，画楼闪闪红裙摇。\n碧蹄偃蹇连金镳，狂情十里飞相烧。\n西母青禽轻飘飘，分环破璧来往劳。\n黄金千镒新一宵，少年心事风中毛。\n明朝何处逢娇饶，门前桃树空夭夭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}